  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Let The Music Take Your Mind** (1 review, 1 other source): Sam, Ryan, and E.D. on bass joined the band for this song; Sam, Ryan, and E.D. on bass joined in for this late-set song [1][2]\n- **Hurry Up...And Wait** (1 review): Sam Kininger sat in with the band for this early-set song [2]\n- **Tuesday Night's Squad** (1 other source): Sam Kininger and Ryan Zoidis joined the band on this late-set tune [1]\n- **Flurries** (1 other source): Sam Kininger and Ryan Zoidis were again on stage with the band for this one [1]\n- **Jam** (1 review): The closing jam was played without any drums [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Talib Kweli freestyle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Talib Kweli freestyle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Let The Music Take Your Mind**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Jam**: back after 90 archived shows (756 days); rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2002-06-08** (recommended): soundboard; 10 songs; 104 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2002-06-08**: taped by (((KB))); transferred by (((KB))); source: SBD > xlr > mackie mixer > RCA - 1/8 [1]",
